62
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:51,000
streaming everywhere for free just Google it where you can throw her some money and buy it on bandcamp H Tom Benjamin plays the title characters on

63
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:58,000
the TV shows Bob's Burgers and Archer and if that were not enough is also the Jazz Daredevil with an actual Jazz album

64
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:02,000
on sub pop records

